Oh. will you...

249
00:13:11.399 --> 00:13:12.657
You are such a...

250
00:13:14.880 --> 00:13:16.002
Chickpea fizz!

251
00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:18.046
Delete. Delete. Delete.

252
00:13:18.214 --> 00:13:19.714
Whatever.
It's your camera.

253
00:13:27.974 --> 00:13:29.808
Please. you've got
to let me back in.

254
00:13:29.976 --> 00:13:32.227
I sold 6.000 rolls
of wrapping paper to get here.

255
00:13:32.395 --> 00:13:33.595
That's your problem.

256
00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:36.565
You. my friend. are banned
from ever entering this church again.

257
00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:39.071
Banned for life?

258
00:13:40.066 --> 00:13:42.234
Homer. do you know
why I'm a christian?

259
00:13:42.405 --> 00:13:46.164
- Your parents made you?
- It's because I believe every soul

260
00:13:46.289 --> 00:13:48.456
has the possibility of salvation.

261
00:13:48.581 --> 00:13:50.745
At least I thought so till now.

262
00:13:50.913 --> 00:13:54.666
Homer Simpson.
you are not worth saving.

263
00:13:54.834 --> 00:13:57.816
What? But I thought we'd
be neighbors in Heaven.

264
00:13:57.941 --> 00:14:00.419
- Goofing on all the new dead people.
- Not...

265
00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:02.417
Worth... Saving!

266
00:14:03.532 --> 00:14:05.093
Ned!
Ned. wait up!

267
00:14:11.684 --> 00:14:13.603
Ned's run off into the desert!

268
00:14:15.224 --> 00:14:18.093
A sand horse: car of the desert!

269
00:14:34.374 --> 00:14:36.562
Nothing like a tall
glass of lukewarm water

270
00:14:36.687 --> 00:14:38.293
to jekyll down this hyde.

271
00:14:39.629 --> 00:14:41.932
Ooh. looks like
a sandstorm's brewing.

272
00:14:42.057 --> 00:14:43.976
I'll just wait it out at a movie.

273
00:14:47.637 --> 00:14:48.982
Orthobot Prime.

274
00:14:49.107 --> 00:14:50.931
the battle begins!

275
00:14:51.099 --> 00:14:54.142
Not so fast. we can't
transform on the Sabbath!

276
00:14:54.310 --> 00:14:57.976
Let us power down
and contemplate the Torah.

277
00:15:09.325 --> 00:15:11.244
Flanders!

278
00:15:11.369 --> 00:15:13.495
Stupid Flanders!

279
00:15:19.033 --> 00:15:21.643
Oh! There's sand in my shoe. too!

280
00:15:28.678 --> 00:15:31.209
Good luck surviving without me!

281
00:15:32.205 --> 00:15:34.080
<i>Thirsty.</i>

282
00:15:34.359 --> 00:15:37.394
<i>I am so thirsty.</i>

283
00:15:37.562 --> 00:15:41.395
<i>And hungry and horny.</i>

284
00:15:41.702 --> 00:15:45.777
<i>but mostly just thirsty.</i>

285
00:15:46.023 --> 00:15:49.155
<i>I am so thirsty.</i>

286
00:15:51.489 --> 00:15:52.534
Water!

287
00:15:53.449 --> 00:15:54.911
DEAD SEA

288
00:15:55.653 --> 00:15:57.281
Oh! So salty!

289
00:15:57.406 --> 00:16:00.709
Maybe if I add a little salt.

290
00:16:28.965 --> 00:16:30.519
You have been chosen. Homer.

291
00:16:30.709 --> 00:16:33.199
Chosen for what. o Mighty Gherkin?

292
00:16:33.458 --> 00:16:35.763
Rise and listen. my child.

293
00:16:36.287 --> 00:16:38.529
Yours is a great destiny.

294
00:16:39.941 --> 00:16:42.220
Pickle. carrot. tomato.
pickle. carrot. tomato.

295
00:16:42.345 --> 00:16:44.628
pickle. carrot. tomato.
pickle. carrot. tomato...

296
00:16:47.001 --> 00:16:49.481
Oh. Homie. you're alive!

297
00:16:50.743 --> 00:16:52.636
I am more than alive. woman.

298
00:16:52.804 --> 00:16:54.751
I am the chosen one

299
00:16:54.876 --> 00:16:57.724
who shall unite all the faiths
of the Holy Land!

300
00:16:58.137 --> 00:16:59.346
I am...

301
00:16:59.471 --> 00:17:00.852
the Messiah!

302
00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:03.146
But you still have
our passports. right?

303
00:17:04.096 --> 00:17:06.432
Oh. yeah.
Got to keep track of those.

304
00:17:07.426 --> 00:17:09.152
The Messiah...

305
00:17:09.277 --> 00:17:10.903
has the passports.

306
00:17:13.675 --> 00:17:16.963
- Dad. are you okay?
- I am more than okay!

307
00:17:17.088 --> 00:17:19.920
I am the Messiah.
come to save the world!

308
00:17:20.045 --> 00:17:21.665
Look upon me and shudder!

309
00:17:21.833 --> 00:17:22.916
I already do that.

310
00:17:23.084 --> 00:17:24.793
Uh... Messiah?

311
00:17:24.961 --> 00:17:26.960
Do you mind if I have
a word with your wife?

312
00:17:27.085 --> 00:17:29.904
As you wish.
But look not upon her with lust.

313
00:17:30.029 --> 00:17:32.116
and do not send her
friendly e-mails.

314
00:17:32.241 --> 00:17:33.684
That's how it begins.

315
00:17:36.222 --> 00:17:38.055
Homer is suffering
from what's called

316
00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:39.557
"Jerusalem syndrome."

317
00:17:39.725 --> 00:17:42.265
Ah. yes. Jerusalem syndrome:

318
00:17:42.390 --> 00:17:45.025
the name given to religious
delusions or psychoses

319
00:17:45.150 --> 00:17:47.202
that occur when people
visit Jerusalem.

320
00:17:47.327 --> 00:17:49.438
Have you ever noticed that
dad always gets the disease

321
00:17:49.563 --> 00:17:51.601
they write about in the
in-flight magazine?

322
00:17:51.726 --> 00:17:54.155
Oh. my God!
Homer's gone!

323
00:17:56.627 --> 00:17:57.992
What's he gonna do now?

324
00:17:58.321 --> 00:18:02.166
Hmm. dad said he was going
to unite all faiths.

325
00:18:02.291 --> 00:18:05.738
And only one site is sacred to muslims.
christians and jews:

326
00:18:05.863 --> 00:18:07.367
The Dome of the Rock!

327
00:18:07.492 --> 00:18:08.692
Dome of the Rock?

328
00:18:08.817 --> 00:18:10.153
Messiah away...!

329
00:18:12.795 --> 00:18:15.149
This one says "Carolina Panthers"!

330
00:18:15.947 --> 00:18:18.012
Messiah says "rowrr!"

331
00:18:19.461 --> 00:18:21.516
Okay. everybody. come on.

332
00:18:21.684 --> 00:18:23.566
This shrine contains the rock

333
00:18:23.691 --> 00:18:26.327
on which Abraham was going
to sacrifice his son.

334
00:18:26.452 --> 00:18:28.520
And muslims believe something. too.

335
00:18:28.691 --> 00:18:31.020
To find out.
hire a muslim tour guide.

336
00:18:31.145 --> 00:18:33.749
That's a barrel of laughs.
Anyway. shut your face.

337
00:18:33.874 --> 00:18:36.068
Thanks. You can stop
giving the tour now.

338
00:18:36.193 --> 00:18:38.676
You don't want to do a photo with me?
You can hold my gun.

339
00:18:38.801 --> 00:18:41.035
I used it in Entebbe.
I killed three ugandans.

340
00:18:41.203 --> 00:18:42.389
No. thanks.

341
00:18:42.938 --> 00:18:45.202
Before you go in.
you fill out comment card.

342
00:18:45.493 --> 00:18:46.499
Okay.

343
00:18:49.003 --> 00:18:50.993
Uh. eh. don't forget the back.

344
00:18:51.118 --> 00:18:52.505
You people are so pushy.

345
00:18:52.673 --> 00:18:54.725
What. israeli people are pushy?

346
00:18:54.850 --> 00:18:57.073
How about you experience
a couple of genocides

347
00:18:57.198 --> 00:18:58.791
and see how laid-back you are?

348
00:18:58.916 --> 00:19:01.626
We were purged from Spain!
Throw out of there!

349
00:19:01.751 --> 00:19:03.368
They allow everybody in Spain!

350
00:19:03.493 --> 00:19:06.019
But for us. jews.
no flamenco. get out!

351
00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:07.893
I'm pushy? Please.

352
00:19:08.018 --> 00:19:09.437
You stay there.

353
00:19:09.562 --> 00:19:12.041
surrounded by your
great enemy. Canada!

354
00:19:12.166 --> 00:19:15.722
Try Syria for two months.
then we'll see who's pushy!

355
00:19:17.127 --> 00:19:20.867
Attention. christians.
muslims. and jews:

356
00:19:21.035 --> 00:19:23.541
I have come to gather
you into a new faith.

357
00:19:23.666 --> 00:19:25.807
From now on. you shall be called...

358
00:19:25.932 --> 00:19:27.415
Chrismujews.

359
00:19:27.583 --> 00:19:29.542
I... I don't know.

360
00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:33.546
Because when you get down to it.
aren't all religions the same?

361
00:19:33.714 --> 00:19:35.348
They tell you what to eat.

362
00:19:35.473 --> 00:19:36.800
when to pray.

363
00:19:36.968 --> 00:19:39.337
how this imperfect
clay that we call man

364
00:19:39.462 --> 00:19:42.222
can mold itself
to resemble the divine.

365
00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:44.872
But we can never attain
that ultimate grace

366
00:19:44.997 --> 00:19:47.543
while there is hatred in
our hearts for each other.

367
00:19:47.668 --> 00:19:49.604
I did it.
I reached him.

368
00:19:49.772 --> 00:19:52.022
Celebrate your commonality.

369
00:19:52.147 --> 00:19:53.607
Some of us don't eat pork.

370
00:19:53.732 --> 00:19:55.652
Some of us don't eat shellfish.

371
00:19:55.820 --> 00:19:58.321
But all of us love chicken.

372
00:19:58.489 --> 00:19:59.989
He's right!

373
00:20:00.157 --> 00:20:03.493
- You can simmer it in a tagine.
- In a soup. you can boil it!

374
00:20:03.661 --> 00:20:05.072
Spread the word!

375
00:20:05.197 --> 00:20:07.163
Peace and chicken.

376
00:20:07.331 --> 00:20:09.582
Peace and chicken!

377
00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:13.169
Don't listen to this fat idiot!
I am your Messiah!

378
00:20:13.337 --> 00:20:16.089
Avert your eyes
from my wrinkly arms!

379
00:20:16.466 --> 00:20:19.606
Uh-oh. Got another case
of Jerusalem syndrome.

380
00:20:19.731 --> 00:20:21.636
This looks like a job for...

381
00:20:21.804 --> 00:20:22.971
The Messiah!

382
00:20:28.745 --> 00:20:31.145
- I want the window seat!
- Krav Maga!

383
00:20:31.428 --> 00:20:33.307
You can't hurt what's already dead.

384
00:20:33.432 --> 00:20:34.576
I guess you can.

385
00:20:34.701 --> 00:20:37.139
Homer. my friend.
of all the false messiahs today.

386
00:20:37.264 --> 00:20:39.196
I think you came
closest to the truth.

387
00:20:39.321 --> 00:20:41.131
Well. if I made any sense today.

388
00:20:41.256 --> 00:20:44.239
it's because all the stuff
you've told me all these years

389
00:20:44.364 --> 00:20:45.850
has finally seeped in.

390
00:20:45.975 --> 00:20:48.246
Can I buy you a $12
turkey sandwich?

391
00:20:48.414 --> 00:20:49.801
I'd like that.

392
00:20:49.926 --> 00:20:53.002
How about a Greg Norman
executive putter from the skymall?

393
00:20:53.127 --> 00:20:55.395
You'd probably get a better deal
at a mall back home.

394
00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:57.171
They have malls on land?

395
00:21:01.969 --> 00:21:05.504
<i>Why don't you try having your people
being thrown out of Spain?!</i>

396
00:21:05.629 --> 00:21:08.853
<i>Spain! No tapas!
I love eating tapas!</i>

397
00:21:08.978 --> 00:21:10.465
<i>I love the tiny portions!</i>

398
00:21:10.590 --> 00:21:11.925
<i>You don't get too full.</i>

399
00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:14.314
<i>but you have a whole
variety of flavors!</i>

400
00:21:14.482 --> 00:21:17.413
<i>Not for me! Every day
hummus and pita!</i>

401
00:21:17.538 --> 00:21:20.474
<i>Occasionally. once a week.
a little bit of falafel!</i>

402
